    "volume_rule": "Each candle's volume is spread over its low-high range with a density of 2 inside the body (between open and close) and 1 on the wicks; each price row receives the share of that density that falls inside it. A candle with no range puts all its volume in the row of its price. The buy share of a candle is (close - low) / (high - low), 0.5 when the range is zero; it is an estimate, not observed order flow.",
